// ---- Voice v1.6: commands, questions, spoken read-back, voice confirmation, pluggable recogniser, mic meter, push-to-talk ----
// Loaded after personal-ui.js. The first half is pure (no DOM) and is also run in node:vm by tests; the UI half only
// runs when a document exists. Every mutation goes preview card → explicit confirm (tap, or a spoken "đồng ý / yes"
// in a short listening window) → one undo. Quantities are never invented: unknown stays empty and must be filled.
// Intent precedence for each part of an utterance (first match wins):
//   1 question (what's cooking / what's missing / where is X cheapest) · 2 urgent family message · 3 attendance
